    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passed Out -Arcade- is a time attack racing game, where you drive fast anti-gravity vehicles !!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Gameplay, slide accross the tracks at high speed, enjoy the various environments, Deserts, Mountains and Mediterranean landscapes !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game today includes 6 ships and 9 tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in an early Alpha version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's to come ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More Tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More Championships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More Categories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Enhanced Boost System</p>",
